  "thesis": "An unlevered BTC allocation that scales monthly exposure to a fixed 40% annualized risk budget using only the latest thirty complete UTC-day close returns may reduce uncompensated volatility and drawdown while preserving enough upside to improve fee-adjusted risk-adjusted performance over passive BTC.",
